@startuml C4_OEM_Service_Logical_Deployment
title C4 – OEM Service (Logical Deployment View)
left to right direction

skinparam node {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor Black
  FontStyle bold
}

skinparam artifact {
  BackgroundColor HoneyDew
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor Black
}

skinparam cloud {
  BackgroundColor LightGray
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor Black
}

actor "Project Manager" as PM

node "DevOps Workstation" as Workstation {
  artifact "CI/CD Pipeline" as Pipeline
}

node "Cloud Subscription" as Subscription {
  node "Network: prod-oem" as Network {
    artifact "Container App: oem-api" as Container
    artifact "API Gateway" as Gateway
  }
  node "Network: shared-services" as Shared {
    cloud "IAM Cluster" as IAM
  }
  node "Database Tier" as DatabaseTier {
    artifact "Managed SQL Database" as Sql
  }
}

Pipeline --> Container : Deploy Docker image
Gateway --> Container : Route /oem/* traffic
Container --> Sql : ODBC/TDS connection
Container --> IAM : Token validation / JWKS fetch
PM --> Pipeline : Trigger releases & view status

@enduml
